Symulator_2022.03.23-07.33.16.781_056.png", "id": "1131739147592444", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031427_1131739150925777_6967941911669488657_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WENN36C9q2cQ7kNvwEhnwsk&_nc_oc=AdqqDrlLfstmtHzy9qegj92fcpn5pJknDK9t9yzMpbB-c-UN2O2k9qHSuv6vKyMOPjA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSwPYzZ4q1SPAxz9JcE9v_HmFFjR24Sy-tE911lwaSe8A&oe=6B05D0B9"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_com.VRFactory.VRBartenderSymulator_2022.03.23-07.34.06.936_774.png", "id": "674566467023618", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569445_674566470356951_7066716002191437089_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ia0liyK24nIQ7kNvwGT5JVG&_nc_oc=AdrHVb6CDHBnazHscKBxPrMHZSdz0guTIdPGnJ0ghiDGHoqgStSURPkClGSrS3JSaNU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ_1ogrCeCkHW1Ds7TtKXyXHhvlR_MVbswsDXZ5ycLDWQ&oe=6B05A6CD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Bartender_[betaversion]_coverlandscape_[2560x1440px]_pop.png", "id": "593815433029642", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974507_593815439696308_1028561643982001387_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zTsBhjHnIOUQ7kNvwECK6O9&_nc_oc=AdomHhY5O91bEjPmsp9xV82qGl7uzg3MLTkbdYgGygcsCf_hQxb6jLGygtzadEoj40o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRQoARY1LsTCsU1_h1tgSeyE8MC0YB8azPyIpWPwmftiA&oe=6B05B822"}, "display_name": "BARTENDER VR SIMULATOR beta version", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# \ud83c\udf1f Step into a world of unforgettable experiences and top-level competition in a hyper-realistic VR bartending game! \ud83c\udf1f\n\n**\ud83c\udf79 Ready for the challenge?** From basic cocktails to the most complex compositions \u2013 every drink brings you closer to mastery. Earn tips, compete for the title of the best, and take control of every bar. Here, it's not just about precision, but also speed!\n\n**\ud83d\udd25 Unlimited possibilities:** Hundreds of drink combinations, various glasses, ice variations, additives, mixing techniques \u2013 all at your fingertips! Master the art of expert juggling, serve drinks faster than others, break objects, and create chaos that adds character to your style!\n\n**\ud83e\udd47 Do you have what it takes to be at the top?** Who will earn the most in each bar? Who will mix drinks faster than their rivals? Fight for the title of the best VR bartender, but be warned \u2013 the rankings change every day! Today you\u2019re on top, tomorrow someone else may take your place. Don\u2019t let them get ahead, and prove that YOU are number one! \n\n**\ud83c\udf0d Real-life bars recreated.** Feel like a true bartending master, ready for challenges and unforgettable adventures. Whether you play for fun or for competition \u2013 this game is a challenge you can't resist! And all of this created under the guidance of six-time World Bartending Champion Tomasz Ma\u0142ek!\n\n**\ud83c\udfc6 Your spot behind the bar is waiting! \ud83c\udf7e\ud83e\udd42**", "short_description": "# \ud83c\udf1f Enter the world of unforgettable experiences and top-level competition in a hyper-realistic VR bartending game! \ud83c\udf1f\n\nHundreds of drink combinations, various glasses, ice variations, additives, mixing techniques \u2013 all at your fingertips! Master the art of juggling, serve drinks faster than others, break objects, and create chaos that will add character to your style!\n\nFight for the title of the best VR bartender.\n\nYour spot behind the bar is waiting!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vrfactorygames.pro/privacy-policy/bartender-vr-simulator-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VR Factory Games S.A.", "support_website_url": "http://www.bartendervrsimulator.com/", "website_url": "http://www.